
  Here's the assembler sources. Should compile with Asm-One v1.29 and with
  little work also on other compilers. I have my offset-includes put in a
  dir/assign "include:offsets".

  My coding style and routines may be simple & stupid and against the
  "book"... well, I don't care as long as they work on my bbs.

